

4) After first login — this is a KIAUH image
--------------------------------------------
KIAUH and the usual component git trees / venvs are already on the card
under /opt/fly-kiauh and are copied into your home on the first boot that
has a real user.

Do not install Simple-AF (pellcorp) on this card.

SSH in as the user you created, then:

  ~/kiauh/kiauh.sh

Use KIAUH to write printer.cfg and enable services. Clones and most pip
work should already be done. Skip Moonraker "speedups" / uvloop compile
on this 512 MB board.

If you install KlipperScreen:

  sudo systemctl disable --now greetd
  sudo systemctl set-default multi-user.target
